    "SPAi 4 is in the Applications folder, but it was moved there in a way that doesn't meet Apple's requirements. Quit SPAi 4, move it to the Desktop in the Finder, move it back to the Applications folder, and then open it again. Also, make sure to move it by itself, not together with other apps." : {
